    "created_at": "2019-09-28T11:51:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-28T11:56:49Z",
    "body": "Having merged in #433, we have now completed translating **all** docs in Japanese!\r\nA **HUGE** thanks to all the generous contributors who helped contribute and review translations for the Japanese docs: @unhappychoice, @cappyzawa, @heyrict, @bookun, and @TsubasaKawajiri. Thank you all for taking the time to help! 🙇 \r\n\r\nWe will soon be adding links to the Japanese README.md on the base README.md, as well as adding badges for translation progress.\r\n\r\nHaving done that, we will begin opening the doors to translations in other languages. All future translation work will be done on the Starship project on Crowdin, accessible via [**translate.starship.rs**](https://translate.starship.rs).\r\n\r\nThe following languages are being added due to the existing interest and userbase in those languages:\r\n- Chinese Simplified\r\n- French\r\n- German\r\n- Russian\r\n\r\nIf you would like to see Starship translated to a language that isn't listed, and would be interested in leading that initiative, please feel free to create an issue. 😄 \r\n\r\nHere's your ping, @nurtext. 😛 ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
